ll,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-17T09:07:46Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T09:28:26Z","closed_at":"2026-03-17T18:52:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117502","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117502.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117502.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-17T18:52:49Z"},"body":"Adds some of the newer folders to the SCU build.\r\n\r\n## Discussion\r\nWhile #106272 attempted to deal with some of the conditional compilation cases (e.g. `disable_physics_2d`), this PR is simpler and less controversial, and just continues with the existing paradigm and adds some of the newer folders.\r\n\r\nThis leads to more modest gains, but still worth having.\r\n\r\nIn some ways with the gradual use of more folders in master, it would be nice to move to a more recursive folder approach, but currently we still mostly manually add `SCsub` files for each folder and this stays with that paradigm, which means periodically adding / removing folders from `scu_builders` to keep the builds working as fast as they can.\r\n\r\n## Build Times\r\n_(on my PC, absolute times vary according to hardware, but relative times should be ballpark indicative)_\r\n| Build | Master (Regular) | Master (SCU) | PR (SCU) |\r\n| ----- | ----- | ---- | ---- |\r\n| Full Rebuild | 5:54 | * | 3:16 |\r\n| Without ThirdParty | 4:29 | 2:08 | 1:52 |\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n* There's some platform specific stuff I haven't added yet as I'm currently linux only (e.g. DirectX12) but these could probably be added too in the long run. I can't really test non-linux stuff easily because the CI only runs SCU for one of the builds afaik.\r\n* Also moves around a few of the existing folders in `scu_builders` to make it more alphabetical so easier to follow.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":